# scripts/opcount: `tailbench bench slotlit N` makes N reads of a generic
# Box[int, Gone] at one type, its failure built in place (FAILJUMP-TYPED),
# caught in the loop. The control is hand Go: a tagged struct read by a
# switch, the failure returned as an error and type-switched.
unit read
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench slotlit {n}
control benchmarks/tailcall/testdata/control
